Z||000000||b lo 0||07-02-2001||02:43 PM||||My dad was coming home from work yesterday on his '77 Kawasaki KZ1000, and he said some kid in a dropped Accord (I repeat-HONDA ACCORD) tried to outrun him at a lane merge.  Dad says the kid was full throttle, winding out to maybe 7k rpm, while Dad wasn't even pushing it halfway.  Apparently this kid douesn't realize that this bike was the fastest streetbikein the WORLD in 1977!  Plus, with the mods on it, he can outrun anything on four wheels, and 90% with two!  Hmmm-Accord-3,000 lbs, 110-120 hp, KZ1000-5-600 lbs w/rider, 105 hp!  Ha!  This guy apparently has WAY too much confidence in his car!<P>------------------<BR>'85 GT (in progress)  <BR>titled ICE-plates B LO 0 <BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.angelfire.com/ga3/audioimagery/ice.gif">     <BR>Go to <A HREF="http://www.audioimagery.i-p.com" TARGET=_blank>www.audioimagery.i-p.com</A>  !!!<P><A HREF="http://clubs.excite.com/welcome/main?cid=.zXb1DJ1lsCL&aid=22&auth=" TARGET=_blank>Pontiac Fiero Owner's Club</A>-Pics, Videos and More-Or Post your Own||||reg||1
