Z||000005||b lo 0||07-03-2001||02:27 AM||||My dad's not a gambler, he's a damn good rider, in fact.  My whole family rides, we don't do anything stupid, and if someone else DOES, we have a VERY good lawyer.  Anyways, one good yank on that right wrist and he's GOOOOooooooooooone (I refuse to ride that bike, scares the hell out of me) and the Accord boy is left saying "What the...".  Besides-if the kid's in such a hurry to get around him, the kid might not notice the (theoretical) Cavalier stopped in the street, hit him, and possibly kill my beloved dad.  So that's my schpiel.<P>PS- The kid ended up merging about 3 carlengths behind him, and Dad cruised right at the speed limit the whole time.||||reg||1
